WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:03.103
Is this going to be like that time
you promised to take me ice skating

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:04.938
and I got really excited
about the ice skating

00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:07.107
but then instead of ice skating,
you left me at home

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:08.441
so you could go to the strip club

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:10.143
and then you took
the strippers ice skating?

00:00:10.243 --> 00:00:11.778
-No.
-Hooray!

